    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the weight\"... honestly, that sounds so much better than trying to force myself to fit into this. it's just exhausting, you know? pretending to care about a world that doesn't even feel real anymore. it's like i'm just waiting for an exit that's already been written, but i'm too scared to just walk through it.",
